---
import BaseLayout from '~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '~/components/page/PageHero.astro';
import Section from '~/components/page/Section.astro';

import Breadcrumbs from '~/components/schema/Breadcrumbs.astro';

import { site } from '~/data/site';

const breadcrumbs = [
  { name: 'Home', href: '/' },
  { name: 'Privacy', href: '/privacy/' },
];

const title = 'Privacy Policy — Mr Painter Dubai';
const description = `How Mr Painter Dubai collects, uses and protects your personal information. UAE Personal Data Protection Law compliant. Last updated ${new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-GB')}.`;
const lastUpdated = new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-GB', { day: 'numeric', month: 'long', year: 'numeric' });
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Legal"
    title="Privacy Policy"
    subtitle={`How we handle your personal information. Last updated ${lastUpdated}.`}
    breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
    ctaPrimary={{ label: 'Contact us', href: '/contact/' }}
  />

  <Section bg="white">
    <div class="prose prose-ink mx-auto max-w-3xl text-ink-700">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink-900">1. Who we are</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base">
        {site.legalName} ("Mr Painter Dubai", "we", "us") is a UAE-registered company operating the website {site.url} and the matching service it provides. Our office is at {site.address.streetAddress}, {site.address.addressLocality}.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold text-ink-900">2. What information we collect</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base">
        <li>Contact details you submit (name, phone, email, area, property type)</li>
        <li>Project details you share with painters through our platform</li>
        <li>Reviews and ratings you leave for vendors</li>
        <li>Technical data automatically collected (IP, browser, pages visited) for analytics</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold text-ink-900">3. How we use your information</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base">
        <li>Match you with painters in your area</li>
        <li>Send your project details to matched painters so they can quote you</li>
        <li>Improve our service through aggregated, anonymous analytics</li>
        <li>Respond to your questions, complaints and warranty claims</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold text-ink-900">4. Who we share information with</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base">
        Your contact details are shared only with the painters you choose to receive quotes from. We never sell your data to third parties or use it for unrelated marketing. We may share anonymised, aggregate statistics for industry research.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold text-ink-900">5. How long we keep your information</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base">
        Quote requests are kept for 24 months to support warranty claims and customer service. Reviews remain public indefinitely (unless you request deletion). Anonymised analytics data may be retained longer for trend analysis.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold text-ink-900">6. Your rights</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base">
        Under UAE Federal Decree-Law No. 45 of 2021 (Personal Data Protection Law), you have the right to access, correct, or request deletion of your personal data, as well as to object to processing for marketing purposes. To exercise any of these rights, email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">{site.email}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold text-ink-900">7. Cookies</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base">
        We use only essential cookies for the site to function and privacy-respecting analytics (no cross-site tracking). You may disable cookies in your browser without losing site functionality, though some features (quote form, WhatsApp click tracking) may be limited.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold text-ink-900">8. Security</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base">
        We use HTTPS encryption end-to-end, role-based admin access with multi-factor authentication, vetted hosting providers with SOC 2 attestation, and quarterly security reviews of our codebase and dependencies. Personal data is encrypted at rest and in transit. Access logs are retained for 12 months and audited monthly for anomalies. No system is 100% secure, but we follow industry best practice and will notify affected users within 72 hours in the unlikely event of a confirmed data breach affecting personal information.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold text-ink-900">9. Children</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base">
        Mr Painter Dubai is intended for users 18 and over. We do not knowingly collect data from minors. If you believe a minor has provided us data, contact us and we will delete it.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold text-ink-900">10. Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base">
        We may update this policy occasionally. Material changes will be highlighted on the homepage for 30 days. The "last updated" date at the top of this page always reflects the current version.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold text-ink-900">11. Third-party services</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base">
        Mr Painter Dubai uses a small number of trusted third-party services to operate the platform. These include: Vercel (web hosting and CDN), Cloudflare (DDoS protection), Google Analytics 4 (configured with IP anonymisation enabled, Google Signals disabled and ad-personalisation disabled — used only for aggregate visitor measurement), Google Search Console (for site indexing health), and WhatsApp Business (for direct lead routing). Each service is contractually obligated to handle your data only on our behalf. We do not run Facebook Pixel, TikTok Pixel, LinkedIn Insight or any other advertising-network tracking on this site.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold text-ink-900">11a. Cookies set by analytics</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base">
        Google Analytics 4 sets a small number of first-party cookies (_ga, _ga_*) used to count unique visitors and measure session duration. These cookies do not contain any personally identifiable information, expire after 13 months, and are not shared with advertising networks. You can opt out at any time by installing the Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on at <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout</a> or by enabling "Do Not Track" / "Global Privacy Control" in your browser, which we honour.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold text-ink-900">12. International data transfers</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base">
        Most Mr Painter Dubai data is stored within the UAE. Some operational data (analytics logs, email systems) may transit through servers in Singapore, Germany or Ireland operated by our hosting and analytics providers. All transfers are encrypted in transit and at rest, and our vendor contracts include the equivalent of EU Standard Contractual Clauses for cross-border data movement.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold text-ink-900">13. Marketing communications</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base">
        We do not send marketing emails unless you have explicitly opted in. We may send a single confirmation email after your quote request and one follow-up after the project is completed inviting you to leave a review. Both messages include an unsubscribe link. WhatsApp messages are sent only in response to your inbound enquiry. We do not run paid retargeting campaigns or share lookalike audiences with advertising platforms.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold text-ink-900">14. Contact</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base">
        Privacy queries: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">{site.email}</a> · {site.phone} · {site.address.streetAddress}, {site.address.addressLocality}.
      </p>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs.map((b) => ({ name: b.name, url: b.href }))} slot="head" />
</BaseLayout>
